{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/1afc4394c78662771073a63c2a34a880.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/1afc4394c78662771073a63c2a34a880.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/1afc4394c78662771073a63c2a34a880.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A brutal dieselpunk heavy-artillery simulator where you dominate the battlefield through a colossal war machine. Every lever, every dial, and every shot is under your control. High Command may send its orders, but the chain of command ends at your fingertips. They don't carry consequences. You do, Operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">MAKE EVERY SHOT COUNT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/84b4cfe6b2b3c6e82142c3dfb77d4d44.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/84b4cfe6b2b3c6e82142c3dfb77d4d44.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/84b4cfe6b2b3c6e82142c3dfb77d4d44.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Calibrate the teleprinters to monitor local radio traffic, push the dial far enough and unfamiliar channels will answer. One delivers High Command's TOP-PRIORITY directives. The other relays direct calls from the frontline.<br>Remember: Sometimes the most useful message is the one nobody intended to send.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/a61aeec73760713aa5039ec10cbc935a.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/a61aeec73760713aa5039ec10cbc935a.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/a61aeec73760713aa5039ec10cbc935a.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Transform intelligence reports into a battle plan, get aerial photos that reveal the outcome of your actions, and watch your barrels reshape the landscape.\u00a0The map isn't here just for measurements. It's also your window to the battlefield.  Make no mistake. You can move the markers, but the scars remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/95b78d10a3f5607a0d753caa32b54a01.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/95b78d10a3f5607a0d753caa32b54a01.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/95b78d10a3f5607a0d753caa32b54a01.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hammer the measurements, crank the numbers, and watch the ballistic calculator grind toward a firing solutions. Drive the charges higher to blast shells across the horizon, or dial it back to arc them deliberately into enemy emplacements.    <br>Beware: the machine may fail. You must not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/5e0da451f75e5acd5444c7a8b907afc4.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/5e0da451f75e5acd5444c7a8b907afc4.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/5e0da451f75e5acd5444c7a8b907afc4.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Breach bunkers with armour-piercing rounds, screen friendly withdrawals with smoke, and \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 with phosgene gas. It never happened if there are no witnesses. Every shell is forged for a single purpose, and whatever you choose will echo across the battlefield long after the smoke clears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/c64f76ae7f9e8b82aa7bbc8bc0835fd4.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/c64f76ae7f9e8b82aa7bbc8bc0835fd4.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/c64f76ae7f9e8b82aa7bbc8bc0835fd4.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Haul the elevation wheel and watch the guns climb under your command. Match it with the exact propellant charge, or a surgical strike will turn into an avoidable mess. Precision is everything, because neither flawless paperwork nor the finest propaganda will erase your guilt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b1e7fa203a6309096750642d3342780f.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b1e7fa203a6309096750642d3342780f.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b1e7fa203a6309096750642d3342780f.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drag the heavy lever and feel the entire structure shudder beneath your feet. A machine like IRON NEST doesn't spin on a whim. It takes time to swing that much iron with grace. Skilled Operators use that time to handle other tasks. After all, the coffee machine on your desk is there for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4a0c1ce91de49204927431ce20fb4296.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4a0c1ce91de49204927431ce20fb4296.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4a0c1ce91de49204927431ce20fb4296.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pull the trigger, and let thousands of tons of machinery answer your call. Feel the turret recoil and watch the frontline crumble under the weight of steel.\u00a0Once the dust settles, only silence remains,\u00a0hanging heavy in the air, and the moment new orders arrive it all begins again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1772894569\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras_big/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.webp?t=1772894569 width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Heavy-Artillery </strong>Simulator </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Dieselpunk</strong> Aesthetics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 Interactive <strong>Tactical Map</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Hands-On </strong>Massive<strong> Mechanisms</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Manual Control</strong> of a 5,000 Ton Turret</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714\u00a0<strong>Procedurally Generated Objectives</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714\u00a0<strong>Endless Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>x8 Challenge Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Leadeboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Handcrafted Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Newspaper Reports</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714\u00a0Unlockable <strong>x30 Ammo Types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714\u00a0Unlockable <strong>x20\u00a0Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>x15 Regions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1772894569\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras_big/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.webp?t=1772894569 width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The campaign is set in an <strong>alternate-history Spain in the late 1920s</strong>, on the brink of a civil war. In this timeline, the monarchy still holds power, and a republican uprising is spreading across the country. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">IRON NEST is a two-person passion project from\u00a0<strong>Nick Talmers</strong> (development) and <strong>Dominik Latos</strong> (propaganda). With 20+ years of combined experience and a lifelong obsession with artillery, interwar machinery, and dieselpunk, we're building the game we've wanted to play for years. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nick has dreamed of IRON NEST for over a decade, and after meeting through developer-publisher collaborations, we decided it was time to bring this heavy spider-turret simulator, dripping with steel and power, to life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Acknowledgements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The response has exceeded our wildest expectations</strong>. Thank you (truly) for every wishlist, message, and bit of support. It means even more because Heavy Turret Simulator is just the first step in the IRON NEST universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1772894569\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras_big/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.webp?t=1772894569 width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>IRON NEST: Heavy Turret Simulator is a first-person heavy artillery experience that blends tactical problem-solving, complex war machine management, and strategic decision-making into a genre of its own.\u00a0Beyond the campaign, compete in challenge modes with leaderboards, and adapt your strategy with a card-based requisition system.</i><br><br><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HEARING LOSS IS NOT SERVICE RELATED</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2950790?t=1772894569","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/2ee73611b64b00f6d9748aee4d56f3d1d2c0f87f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772894569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/922472560f653fd897313ab7a10dd86b018d373f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772894569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/922472560f653fd897313ab7a10dd86b018d373f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772894569","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/1afc4394c78662771073a63c2a34a880.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/1afc4394c78662771073a63c2a34a880.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/1afc4394c78662771073a63c2a34a880.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A brutal dieselpunk heavy-artillery simulator where you dominate the battlefield through a colossal war machine. Every lever, every dial, and every shot is under your control. High Command may send its orders, but the chain of command ends at your fingertips. They don't carry consequences. You do, Operator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">MAKE EVERY SHOT COUNT.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/84b4cfe6b2b3c6e82142c3dfb77d4d44.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/84b4cfe6b2b3c6e82142c3dfb77d4d44.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/84b4cfe6b2b3c6e82142c3dfb77d4d44.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Calibrate the teleprinters to monitor local radio traffic, push the dial far enough and unfamiliar channels will answer. One delivers High Command's TOP-PRIORITY directives. The other relays direct calls from the frontline.<br>Remember: Sometimes the most useful message is the one nobody intended to send.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/a61aeec73760713aa5039ec10cbc935a.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/a61aeec73760713aa5039ec10cbc935a.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/a61aeec73760713aa5039ec10cbc935a.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Transform intelligence reports into a battle plan, get aerial photos that reveal the outcome of your actions, and watch your barrels reshape the landscape.\u00a0The map isn't here just for measurements. It's also your window to the battlefield.  Make no mistake. You can move the markers, but the scars remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/95b78d10a3f5607a0d753caa32b54a01.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/95b78d10a3f5607a0d753caa32b54a01.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/95b78d10a3f5607a0d753caa32b54a01.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hammer the measurements, crank the numbers, and watch the ballistic calculator grind toward a firing solutions. Drive the charges higher to blast shells across the horizon, or dial it back to arc them deliberately into enemy emplacements.    <br>Beware: the machine may fail. You must not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/5e0da451f75e5acd5444c7a8b907afc4.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/5e0da451f75e5acd5444c7a8b907afc4.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/5e0da451f75e5acd5444c7a8b907afc4.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Breach bunkers with armour-piercing rounds, screen friendly withdrawals with smoke, and \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 \u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588 with phosgene gas. It never happened if there are no witnesses. Every shell is forged for a single purpose, and whatever you choose will echo across the battlefield long after the smoke clears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/c64f76ae7f9e8b82aa7bbc8bc0835fd4.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/c64f76ae7f9e8b82aa7bbc8bc0835fd4.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/c64f76ae7f9e8b82aa7bbc8bc0835fd4.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Haul the elevation wheel and watch the guns climb under your command. Match it with the exact propellant charge, or a surgical strike will turn into an avoidable mess. Precision is everything, because neither flawless paperwork nor the finest propaganda will erase your guilt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b1e7fa203a6309096750642d3342780f.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b1e7fa203a6309096750642d3342780f.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b1e7fa203a6309096750642d3342780f.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Drag the heavy lever and feel the entire structure shudder beneath your feet. A machine like IRON NEST doesn't spin on a whim. It takes time to swing that much iron with grace. Skilled Operators use that time to handle other tasks. After all, the coffee machine on your desk is there for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4a0c1ce91de49204927431ce20fb4296.poster.avif?t=1772894569\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4a0c1ce91de49204927431ce20fb4296.webm?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4a0c1ce91de49204927431ce20fb4296.mp4?t=1772894569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pull the trigger, and let thousands of tons of machinery answer your call. Feel the turret recoil and watch the frontline crumble under the weight of steel.\u00a0Once the dust settles, only silence remains,\u00a0hanging heavy in the air, and the moment new orders arrive it all begins again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1772894569\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras_big/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.webp?t=1772894569 width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Heavy-Artillery </strong>Simulator </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Dieselpunk</strong> Aesthetics </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 Interactive <strong>Tactical Map</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Hands-On </strong>Massive<strong> Mechanisms</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Manual Control</strong> of a 5,000 Ton Turret</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714\u00a0<strong>Procedurally Generated Objectives</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714\u00a0<strong>Endless Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>x8 Challenge Modes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Leadeboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Handcrafted Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>Newspaper Reports</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714\u00a0Unlockable <strong>x30 Ammo Types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714\u00a0Unlockable <strong>x20\u00a0Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2714 <strong>x15 Regions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1772894569\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras_big/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.webp?t=1772894569 width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The campaign is set in an <strong>alternate-history Spain in the late 1920s</strong>, on the brink of a civil war. In this timeline, the monarchy still holds power, and a republican uprising is spreading across the country. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Team</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">IRON NEST is a two-person passion project from\u00a0<strong>Nick Talmers</strong> (development) and <strong>Dominik Latos</strong> (propaganda). With 20+ years of combined experience and a lifelong obsession with artillery, interwar machinery, and dieselpunk, we're building the game we've wanted to play for years. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Nick has dreamed of IRON NEST for over a decade, and after meeting through developer-publisher collaborations, we decided it was time to bring this heavy spider-turret simulator, dripping with steel and power, to life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Acknowledgements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The response has exceeded our wildest expectations</strong>. Thank you (truly) for every wishlist, message, and bit of support. It means even more because Heavy Turret Simulator is just the first step in the IRON NEST universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1772894569\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras_big/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.webp?t=1772894569 width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>IRON NEST: Heavy Turret Simulator is a first-person heavy artillery experience that blends tactical problem-solving, complex war machine management, and strategic decision-making into a genre of its own.\u00a0Beyond the campaign, compete in challenge modes with leaderboards, and adapt your strategy with a card-based requisition system.</i><br><br><br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HEARING LOSS IS NOT SERVICE RELATED</strong> </p>","developers":["Nick Nieuwoudt","Dominik Latos"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/e6c9e990560078611472e5dab98e79a405ed33f4/header.jpg?t=1772894569","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2950790/2037209265/97a121c858a5069187d92e334df5ebb68669d3e8/1764083481/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764234966","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2950790/2037209265/97a121c858a5069187d92e334df5ebb68669d3e8/1764083481/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764234966","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2950790/2037209265/97a121c858a5069187d92e334df5ebb68669d3e8/1764083481/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764234966","id":257237701,"name":"Classified Transmission Captured...","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257237701/84515d2cac090780fd28ed741ed3ac59a1c5ba15/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764234966"}],"name":"IRON NEST: Heavy Turret Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Nick Nieuwoudt","Dominik Latos"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cYou were getting bored of turrets in war games? Fools! You have never experienced one from the inside.\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cThe game is proudly taking inspiration from PVKK.\u201d<br>IGN<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950